CM_ SG_ 1394 DriverSeatbeltState "Vehicle-validated on learn-20260805T154951Z-57acfc99 at standstill: 2-1-2-1-2 while DriverDoorOpen and ParkingBrakeActive stayed false. Seven local sessions contain 1/2 transitions; road captures support 1=unlatched and 2=latched. Values 0 and 3 remain reserved/unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 1416 OilPressureSwitch "Validated as a logical warning contact: active with engine stopped and inactive with engine running. This is not an oil-pressure measurement in bar.";
